## z3randomizer (KatDevsGames) — custom randomizer art

The Triforce Piece and magic-decanter pixel art in
`assets/rando/custom_item_gfx.png` (built into `zelda3_assets.dat` as the
`kRandoCustomItemGfx` asset) is custom art from the ALTTPR randomizer ROM-asm
repository (`z3randomizer`). The committed PNG is regenerated locally from
palette-indexed pixel rows with an authored preview palette; the generator does
not use ROM-derived palette words or item-offset tables. The Rupoor uses the
attributed z3randomizer `off_black` custom palette constant in `src/sprite.c`.
The sparse medallion-entrance BG glyph patches in
`src/rando/medallion_icons.c` are derived from the same MIT z3randomizer art
blobs (`data/99ff1_bombos.gfx`, `data/99ff1_quake.gfx`,
`data/a6fc4_bombos.gfx`, `data/a6fc4_ether.gfx`) so shuffled Misery Mire and
Turtle Rock entrance plaques show the assigned medallion.
Per OpenSpec change `add-rando-field-item-custom-art`.

