## Enemizer — enemy-shuffle constraint provenance

The enemy-shuffle constraint generator in `assets/scripts/gen_enemy_shuffle_tables.py`
parses Enemizer's `SpriteRequirement.cs` and `SpriteConstants.cs` to emit the
sheet, slot, room-safety, boss, and overlord facts embedded in
`src/rando/shuffle_enemies.c`. The generated tables are structural facts used to
keep enemy substitutions render-safe and beatable; they are not ROM-extracted
graphics or level data.

